  "id": "surveillance-report-from-the-xianzhou-yuque",
  "name": "Surveillance Report from the Xianzhou Yuque",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Surveillance_Report_from_the_Xianzhou_Yuque",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-08-05T09:30:44.801Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "For Chief Counselor Qingzu's eyes only,"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-017f1cffc5d3b0f9"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The Xianzhou Yuque is currently trekking around the periphery of the Giant's Arm star cluster, plotting an ancient course as it continues explorations."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7bba21380f88a5e2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Twenty-six sidereal hours ago, the Cloudpeer Telescope captured signals from Reignbow's Lux Arrow traversing through three of its coordinates. The master diviner has interpreted this as a divine mandate."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-2f166b69d1c16d02"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The Marshal issued orders, and the Yaoqing Cloud Knights' Heroncrest Fleet and Red Ballad Fleet have both set out on patrol as hereby informed."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6ea43bb7265702ea"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We also include a recent scouting report of enemy movements for strategic planning."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-d4febfb8039d6a7f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "[Stamp]\nRegards,\nDivination Commission, Xianzhou Yuque"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-cf2fde9ab8d48fb4"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Must be opened with Chief Counselor's Seal"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-1713903e26a2516b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [],
            "id": "p-882a20e6379eb83a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The Great Brood Lord Angsin leads his hunting pack into the Echidna skywall, struggling to fight off the hostile Shepherds Fleet."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Their fleet consists of 16 beast ships and 325 battleships."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We expect to observe the borisin's internal war in the upcoming days. We will send out another battle report once the time comes."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7270be0dea6b2684"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Threat posed to the Luofu: Very low."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-41f4b76a57c3999c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [],
            "id": "p-882a20e6379eb83a-2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Based on IPC data, the wingweavers' Peacock Angel legion has arrived at the Consternation Starzone to locate a Stellaron and revive their homeworld of Muldrasil."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The veracity of this information is yet to be verified."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-5949c8909a38d6d4"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Threat posed to the Luofu: Very low."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-41f4b76a57c3999c-2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [],
            "id": "p-882a20e6379eb83a-3"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "An industrial planet along the Luofu's route, the Baranza Forge, has been completely neutralized by the Lord Ravager Irontomb's assault."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Diviners have performed calculations, and the probability of victory is infinitesimally close to zero."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f8e5ca0bbe287588"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Threat to the Luofu: Medium low."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Suggested countermeasures: Order the Divination Commission to monitor electrical signals from Irontomb's vehicle, and remain vigilant about its movements."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-997d899849eef4a4"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
